[[File:Shou Okabe.png|thumb|220px|Shou Okabe]]
(Japanese: '''岡部翔''' ''Shou Okabe'') is a character in [[Aim to Be a Card Master!!]], a manga series taking place in the real world. Shou first appears in [[MCM1|the beginning of the story]] when he easily defeats the main character, [[Kenta Minamii]]. From that moment, Kenta's goal is to beat Shou.

